# Pairs with ShippingNeverSkips. The reader is clamped at the allocator's next
# offset rather than at the durable-contiguous watermark (WalShippingWatermark),
# so with flushes completing out of order it reads past a still-unfilled hole.
MODULE: ShippingNeverSkipsReaderIgnoresInflight
TARGET: ShippingNeverSkips
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a reader is shown offsets above an in-flight append
PERTURBS: ReadStep

--- FIND
    /\ ReadFrom(l) < Watermark
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the horizon ignores in-flight flushes.
    /\ ReadFrom(l) < next
--- END